[{"h":0.013081395090518866,"x":0.010917048553768644,"text":"6 Read the task below. Then read the 'for and against'","w":0.43449779510498043,"y":0.040697674378190163},{"w":0.42139736175537107,"text":"essay and complete the gaps with the correct form of","y":0.053660565968303375,"x":0.034934499871950811,"h":0.014653387561614051},{"y":0.069767442034359695,"w":0.17467248916625977,"h":0.011763339828135821,"x":0.034934499521673566,"text":"the words in brackets."},{"h":0.013311148483225566,"x":0.034934505990578124,"y":0.097337770369958054,"text":"Write an essay on the topic 'Is Fair Trade really fair?'","w":0.41048034667968747},{"h":0.013103161000967423,"y":0.11189683879719903,"text":"In the essay present arguments for and against this","w":0.39956329345703123,"x":0.034934514472357708},{"w":0.40829692840576176,"h":0.013081395090518866,"x":0.034934512034382373,"y":0.12645348847702742,"text":"initiative, including examples and your own opinion."},{"w":0.27292575836181643,"text":"Is Fair Trade really fair?","y":0.16846921802710013,"x":0.098253280298713289,"h":0.019134775374376023},{"y":0.19331395354485681,"text":"Consumers in many countries","w":0.25109169006347659,"x":0.021834071816878763,"h":0.013081395090518977},{"y":0.19217844331708189,"h":0.015352415760821025,"x":0.27921556617528176,"text":"are becoming","w":0.1184247589111328},{"w":0.04366812229156497,"x":0.40829694394883176,"h":0.0072674418051111855,"y":0.1962209301875607,"text":"more"},{"w":0.36899562835693361,"h":0.011785106135287382,"text":"and more aware of the harmful effects of","y":0.20784883731536752,"x":0.019650663587180758},{"w":0.061135368347167984,"h":0.011627906570815472,"text":"human","y":0.20784883721846825,"x":0.38864628889774067},{"x":0.12445415104357054,"y":0.22088186395438769,"w":0.22925764083862304,"text":"(CONSUME) and both the ?","h":0.016222961730449237},{"w":0.4301309967041016,"h":0.01455906821963393,"y":0.23835274579444987,"x":0.019650662437614378,"text":"(ENVIRONMENT) and ethical issues it creates. That is"},{"y":0.25415973344770038,"h":0.014735615392294621,"x":0.019650654551879435,"w":0.43013099670410154,"text":"why the Fair Trade organisation was designed - to help"},{"w":0.42794757843017578,"h":0.013311148483225566,"y":0.2687188016919636,"text":"and protect farmers in poor countries. It seems to be a good","x":0.021834075326396772},{"y":0.28124567633512232,"text":"initiative, but is it really Aan \/ - \/ the idea that we can fully","w":0.43039764404296876,"h":0.018216918589866515,"x":0.019520485318308401},{"y":0.29414225402841543,"h":0.020381681534295759,"w":0.18876808166503906,"x":0.019084255156677051,"text":"approve Bof\/on \/ with?"},{"y":0.32113144762538792,"x":0.021834070343363942,"text":"On the one hand, Fair Trade tries to make sure that the","h":0.011717389308275594,"w":0.4301309967041016},{"y":0.33569051598980515,"text":"producers in poorer countries earn more money. It helps","x":0.021834059590089085,"h":0.014600181738271156,"w":0.43013099670410154},{"x":0.021834069466949765,"w":0.31004365921020505,"text":"farmers create a better infrastructure,","h":0.013311148483225566,"y":0.35024958390640615},{"h":0.01308865079070487,"x":0.021834069932731487,"w":0.2379912567138672,"text":"(STRONG) their position","y":0.36627906982392655},{"text":"in the","h":0.011627906570815361,"w":0.065502181053161634,"x":0.25982532774125039,"y":0.36627906977660785},{"y":0.38226744185352657,"w":0.4301309967041016,"text":"(AGRICULTURE) sector, and invest their money wisely.","x":0.019650661925553658,"h":0.014571160524339821},{"h":0.013081395090518866,"x":0.021834072135576327,"y":0.39680232563788009,"w":0.43013099670410154,"text":"Such a practice is definitely something everyone can agree"},{"w":0.12061961174011231,"h":0.012609099389709333,"text":"Cat \/ for \/ with.","x":0.021591128859215727,"y":0.41010504961143079},{"y":0.43302828630440926,"x":0.024017467715200809,"text":"Sadly, at the same time the Fair Trade model seems to","h":0.013311147689819336,"w":0.42576419830322265},{"w":0.19748085021972656,"text":"challenge some ethical 5","x":0.023568059331968847,"y":0.44528250572073191,"h":0.018120240451095615},{"text":"(BELIEVE). For","x":0.32096069940535371,"w":0.13100436210632327,"y":0.44912790710477246,"h":0.014682408775545497},{"h":0.017474490275200538,"w":0.4304963684082031,"x":0.021660798357679631,"text":"instance, some online sources suggest that in fact only a","y":0.46092440868319395},{"text":"small number of farmers benefit from the system. In Africa,","w":0.43013099670410154,"x":0.021834068278225694,"h":0.014730777994368505,"y":0.47819767471620667},{"text":"Pwhich \/ that \/ where farmers need more support, just a","h":0.016370325834302868,"x":0.023891154851486254,"w":0.42598930358886716,"y":0.49269103096127664},{"y":0.50872093025157483,"w":0.43231441497802731,"h":0.014573578826599598,"text":"few countries are helped. In addition, some studies claim","x":0.019650658176925049},{"h":0.013311148086522451,"y":0.52454242921185135,"w":0.42794757843017583,"text":"that the poor communities receive only a small amount","x":0.02401748143993384},{"text":"of the profit and that most of the money goes to the","w":0.42794757843017578,"y":0.53910149746838787,"h":0.01467757217102561,"x":0.024017482509802797},{"w":0.42576419830322265,"x":0.024017468424807831,"text":"companies which transport, pack and sell the final product.","y":0.55523255822508943,"h":0.013081395090518866},{"text":"Some experts say this is","x":0.021834065535667441,"w":0.19432313919067382,"y":0.56821963399712683,"h":0.016222961730449237},{"x":0.31004366726526655,"h":0.014675153868765722,"text":"(AVOID), but it is","y":0.56976744200302842,"w":0.14192139625549316},{"h":0.014600181738271156,"w":0.43231441497802736,"x":0.019650648449851042,"text":"something that one may criticise the Fair Trade initiative","y":0.58569051593893318},{"y":0.59867824953343629,"h":0.01630629160241559,"w":0.12890922546386718,"text":"Efor \/ by \/ with.","x":0.019606521028893306},{"h":0.011627906570815361,"text":"In conclusion, it seems to me that Fair Trade is an initiative","x":0.024017482509802797,"w":0.42794757843017578,"y":0.62209302342244122},{"y":0.63654541830880829,"x":0.023924107176493799,"w":0.42811473846435549,"h":0.01554214855200442,"text":"which only looks like a good idea. However, we need to"},{"h":0.013081395090518866,"y":0.65261627925343246,"text":"remember it is also a business strategy that brings money","w":0.43013099670410154,"x":0.021834059590089085},{"y":0.66591482434968718,"x":0.023788797125096642,"h":0.015534023278564901,"w":0.10795620918273928,"text":"to large and ?"},{"h":0.015988372129925876,"text":"(POWER) companies. In my","x":0.22707424084698311,"y":0.6671511627116844,"w":0.22489082336425784},{"y":0.68168604638529584,"x":0.024017475522903418,"text":"opinion, we need to do more to make sure Fair Trade really","w":0.42794757843017583,"h":0.014653387561614051},{"x":0.021834067405880512,"h":0.016222961730449237,"text":"helps the poor people and not only itself.","y":0.69758735435085417,"w":0.30349344253540045},{"text":"7 Read the essay again and choose the correct options A-E.","h":0.013081395090518977,"x":0.48689957527111316,"y":0.040697674529595163,"w":0.44978164672851562},{"text":"8 You are going to write a 'for and against' essay on","w":0.42139736175537107,"x":0.48689957766489073,"y":0.065307820475636325,"h":0.013311147689819336},{"x":0.51310045250633263,"h":0.011702878701309927,"text":"the topic 'Money can buy happiness.' Mark these","y":0.0798668885012489,"w":0.38646286010742192},{"text":"arguments as F (for) or A (against).","x":0.51310044247120234,"y":0.09442595661544273,"w":0.27292575836181643,"h":0.013311148483225677},{"text":"People get pleasure from nice possessions.","w":0.32096069335937494,"x":0.53930131805830361,"y":0.11480865219435443,"h":0.013098324396447647},{"w":0.017467248439788752,"h":0.013081395090518866,"text":"E","y":0.11482558168802548,"x":0.91921397414255102},{"y":0.13372093067890145,"w":0.013100435733795157,"h":0.010174418051111855,"x":0.5131004372277167,"text":"1"},{"text":"2","h":0.010174418051111966,"w":0.013100436925888026,"x":0.5131004364497197,"y":0.15116279084726381},{"x":0.53711791610442328,"h":0.013311148086522451,"y":0.13352745425560619,"w":0.30567684173583987,"text":"Friendship and love don't cost anything."},{"h":0.016477695915742663,"x":0.53477040974166878,"w":0.31041381835937509,"text":"In many places education and healthcare","y":0.1487513447596297},{"w":0.094050035476684557,"h":0.012227659812584446,"text":"are not free.","y":0.16539779785691289,"x":0.53921952399409279},{"x":0.51310043700937602,"y":0.18313953499091684,"w":0.013100435733795157,"text":"3","h":0.010174418051111966},{"y":0.18302828599249299,"w":0.31441047668457034,"h":0.013311148086522451,"text":"If you have money, you can see the world","x":0.53711790052234387},{"h":0.0087209303248146908,"w":0.015283842086791899,"text":"4","x":0.51310043728993737,"y":0.20203488357790278},{"h":0.013311147689819336,"text":"Life is full of simple pleasures.","w":0.23362443923950205,"x":0.52838429082420812,"y":0.20049916806824375},{"text":"5 Happiness comes from achieving your goals.","x":0.51310044430449575,"y":0.21947674429098085,"w":0.36244541168212896,"h":0.013081395090518866},{"x":0.49999999875256412,"w":0.26637554168701166,"y":0.25124792026113973,"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT","h":0.011833474957407386},{"x":0.4934497834172758,"y":0.27745424267683627,"w":0.34061134338378912,"h":0.013311148483225566,"text":"9 'Money can buy happiness.' Write an essay"},{"x":0.51310043493142732,"y":0.29201331089089899,"w":0.35807861328125001,"h":0.013311148483225566,"text":"in which you present arguments for and against"},{"h":0.013311148086522451,"w":0.34716156005859378,"text":"this statement and give your personal opinion.","x":0.51310044701764623,"y":0.30657237927574665},{"w":0.37554584503173827,"h":0.013311148086522451,"text":"You can use the ideas in Exercise 8 to help you.","x":0.51310044618864314,"y":0.3211314476000322},{"x":0.6746724891817284,"h":0.026162790181037843,"y":0.38372093070889968,"w":0.043668122291564915,"text":"E"},{"y":0.6031613976451593,"text":"SHOW THAT YOU'VE CHECKED","w":0.27292575836181643,"h":0.0116641834849327,"x":0.50218341097816843},{"w":0.29039300918579103,"text":"Finished? Always check your writing.","h":0.011831056655147498,"x":0.50000000437726455,"y":0.62770382681436865},{"h":0.013081395090518866,"y":0.64098837213739557,"x":0.50000000179000925,"w":0.29475982666015621,"text":"Can you tick \/ everything on this list?"},{"y":0.66555740421654608,"w":0.23144104003906246,"text":"In my 'for and against' essay:","h":0.013311148086522451,"x":0.4978166001988093},{"y":0.68749999996564171,"w":0.32969432830810547,"text":"• the first paragraph begins with general or","h":0.013081395090518866,"x":0.499999994443109},{"text":"factual comments about the topic.","x":0.5152838408508833,"y":0.70203488377854584,"h":0.011775432529544716,"w":0.25982532501220712},{"h":0.013311148086522451,"text":"• the first paragraph ends with a statement that","w":0.36026199340820309,"x":0.50000001126533067,"y":0.72088186339580118},{"x":0.5152838489462106,"y":0.73544093187262261,"w":0.24890829086303723,"h":0.011652091180227031,"text":"mentions both sides of the issue."},{"text":"• the second paragraph presents arguments for","y":0.75290697680067065,"w":0.36244541168212885,"h":0.013081395090518866,"x":0.5000000076232729},{"text":"the topic and supports them with examples.","h":0.011804453346772936,"x":0.51528384433393848,"y":0.76871880219154187,"w":0.32969432830810552},{"text":"• the third paragraph presents arguments against","x":0.5000000079426461,"y":0.78618968387058941,"w":0.37554584503173827,"h":0.011775432132841601},{"x":0.51528383944856737,"y":0.8007487520211205,"w":0.32969432830810552,"text":"the topic and supports them with examples.","h":0.013311148086522451},{"text":"• the final paragraph includes a summarising","w":0.33624454498291012,"h":0.013311148483225566,"x":0.49999999404784634,"y":0.81821963393335384},{"x":0.51528384458182841,"text":"statement and my personal opinion.","w":0.27292575836181643,"y":0.83277870208919669,"h":0.011698041700087036},{"y":0.85174418614046443,"h":0.011816546048181831,"x":0.50000001308076658,"w":0.36681221008300791,"text":"• I have not used contractions (e.g. I'm \/ aren't\/"},{"w":0.32751091003417976,"x":0.51746725650037728,"y":0.866279069934069,"text":"that's) or abbreviations (info \/ CU \/ v. good).","h":0.011627906570815361},{"h":0.011816546048181831,"text":"• I have checked my spelling.","w":0.22489082336425786,"x":0.4999999994168523,"y":0.88643926775079163},{"x":0.49999999724565319,"w":0.20524017333984385,"y":0.90973377692065738,"h":0.011777850831804604,"text":"• My text is neat and clear."},{"w":0.02401746749877931,"h":0.017441860649629382,"text":"O","x":0.9017467246567239,"y":0.69186046489943775},{"h":0.015988372129925876,"text":"O","w":0.02401746749877931,"x":0.90174672461578509,"y":0.82267441866795865},{"text":"69","w":0.026200873851776052,"h":0.011627906570815472,"y":0.9636627909733132,"x":0.90611353665489791}]